---
# Unlisted answer pages for the social quiz posts: /a/<slug>/ shows one
# confusion class fully revealed (word + signature on every tile), exactly
# what the quiz image hides. Reached ONLY by the link Peter posts —
# excluded from collections (so the sitemap never lists them), noindexed
# (so search engines that follow a shared link keep them out of results),
# and /a/ itself redirects home. AI crawlers are barred from /a/ in
# robots.txt.
pagination:
  data: answers
  size: 1
  alias: a
permalink: "/a/{{ a.slug }}/"
layout: base.njk
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
robots: "noindex, nofollow, noimageindex"
title: "The answer"
description: "Which word belongs to which picture — revealed."
---
<section class="hero answer-hero">
  <p class="muted answer-kicker">You found the reveal 🔭</p>
  <h1>Which word goes where</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every tile, with its word and the nuance that gives it away.</p>
</section>

<section class="answer-sheet">
  {% if a.pos or a.definition %}
  <header class="answer-centroid">
    {% if a.pos %}<p class="answer-pos">{{ a.pos }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% if a.definition %}<p class="answer-def">{{ a.definition }}</p>{% endif %}
  </header>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="answer-tiles{% if a.words.length % 2 == 1 %} odd-count{% endif %}">
    {% for w in a.words %}
    <figure class="answer-tile">
      <img src="{{ w.image }}" alt="Illustration for '{{ w.word }}'{% if w.signature %} — {{ w.signature }}{% endif %}" loading="lazy" width="512" height="512">
      {% if w.signature %}<p class="answer-signature">{{ w.signature }}</p>{% endif %}
      <figcaption class="answer-word">{{ w.word }}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-box">
  <h2>These tiles are from Lexi</h2>
  <p>Lexi teaches vocabulary with spaced repetition delivered through
  crossword puzzles built just for you — and drills confusable words like
  these with contrast panels, until the nuances stick. Every word you learn
  becomes a star in your own night sky.</p>
  <p>
    <a class="btn" href="{{ site.appstore }}">Download free on the App&nbsp;Store</a>
    &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/">See what Lexi is →</a>
  </p>
  <p class="muted">iPhone &amp; iPad · free · no ads · no account required</p>
</section>
